# It has to be listed *here* because Prettier reads the **root** .gitignore and
# never a nested one — so the folder is invisible to git and fully visible to
# `prettier --check .`. A plan doc nobody could see in `git status` failed the
# verify gate for two sessions in one afternoon, and the second one lost time
# proving the file was innocent before finding the mechanism.
